Value SYSTEM_SOFTWARE (\S+)
Value MODEL (.+)
Value UPTIME (.+)
Value PATCH_VERSION (\S+)

Start
  ^Huawei\s+(YunShan\s+OS|Versatile\s+Routing\s+Platform)\s+Software
  ^Version\s+\S+\s+\(\S+\s+${SYSTEM_SOFTWARE}\)
  ^Copyright\s+\(C\)\s+.*Huawei\s+Technologies\s+Co\.,\s+Ltd\.
  ^(HUAWEI|Huawei|Quidway)\s+.*\s+uptime\s+is\s+${UPTIME}
  ^Patch\s+Version\s*:\s+${PATCH_VERSION}
  ^3\.Board\s+Type\s+:\s+${MODEL}
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Continue
